    <worksheet name='Teacher Staffing Scenario'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontsize='20'>&lt;Sheet Name&gt;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='Project4_Staffing_Detail' name='federated.0xtiyg20mh22u41gpci9z18xz4zn' />
            <datasource name='Parameters' />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='Parameters'>
            <column caption='Additional Teacher FTE' datatype='real' default-format='n#,##0.0;-#,##0.0' name='[Parameter 0714191867203584]' param-domain-type='range' role='measure' type='quantitative' value='1.0'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='1.0' />
              <range granularity='0.5' max='10.0' min='0.0' />
            </column>
            <column caption='Annual Cost per Added Teacher FTE' datatype='real' default-format='c&quot;$&quot;#,##0.00;(&quot;$&quot;#,##0.00)' name='[Parameter 0714191868215297]' param-domain-type='any' role='measure' type='quantitative' value='101766.37'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='101766.37' />
            </column>
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.0xtiyg20mh22u41gpci9z18xz4zn'>
            <column caption='Estimated Additional Annual Cost' datatype='real' default-format='c&quot;$&quot;#,##0;(&quot;$&quot;#,##0)' name='[Calculation_0714191868628994]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='[Parameters].[Parameter 0714191867203584] * [Parameters].[Parameter 0714191868215297]' />
            </column>
            <column-instance column='[Calculation_0714191868628994]' derivation='Min' name='[min:Calculation_0714191868628994:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <aggregation value='true' />
        </view>
        <style />
        <panes>
          <pane selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-allow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Text' />
            <encodings>
              <text column='[federated.0xtiyg20mh22u41gpci9z18xz4zn].[min:Calculation_0714191868628994:qk]' />
            </encodings>
            <customized-label>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Courier New' fontsize='18'>Estimated additional annual salary and benefits</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='18'><![CDATA[<[federated.0xtiyg20mh22u41gpci9z18xz4zn].[min:Calculation_0714191868628994:qk]>]]></run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='16'>Hypothetical staffing scenario</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='16'>Estimated additional annual salary and benefits = additional teacher FTE × assumed annual cost per FTE. </run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='16'>The initial assumption is $101,766.37 per teacher FTE, based on total teacher salary and benefits divided by total teacher FTE in the supplied 2025–26 synthetic staffing data.</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='16'>The estimate assumes a full year of employment and scales linearly. It is an average-cost assumption, not a new-hire quote. </run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='16'>Funding capacity, fixed costs, and class scheduling require separate analysis. This estimate does not establish affordability, feasible class sizes, or expected student outcomes. </run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='16'>Existing staffing costs are already included in finance totals; this scenario displays incremental cost separately. </run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='16'>Synthetic demonstration — not an actual district.</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='16'> Costs are nominal, partial operating expenses.</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-label>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='mark'>
                <format attr='mark-labels-show' value='true' />
                <format attr='mark-labels-cull' value='true' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
          </pane>
        </panes>
        <rows />
        <cols />
      </table>
      <simple-id uuid='{E1E6670C-AD38-40E5-880F-28C994EB3699}' />
    </worksheet>
  </worksheets>
